WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:03.474
You want to try a new programme with one class first, but

00:00:03.474 --> 00:00:06.707
planning the pilot, the parent meeting and the review takes

00:00:06.707 --> 00:00:08.187
more time than teaching it.

00:00:09.194 --> 00:00:12.992
A 6 to 8 week pilot plan and schedule, a teacher guide, a

00:00:12.992 --> 00:00:16.923
parent orientation script and FAQ, student onboarding, demo

00:00:16.923 --> 00:00:20.588
lesson outlines for Levels 1 to 5, worksheets, a parent

00:00:20.588 --> 00:00:24.119
reporting template and an end-of-pilot review report.

00:00:25.118 --> 00:00:27.705
690,000 dong per centre.

00:00:27.705 --> 00:00:30.805
See the sample, or message Mr. Jay on Zalo.

